                  beneath it — 32svh clears that on a 667px screen, the shortest
                  phone worth designing for. Desktop puts the image beside the
                  copy instead of above it and has the height to spare. */}
              <div class="rr-services__figure">
                <MaterialImage
                  src={service.src}
                  alt={service.alt}
                  materialLabel={service.label.toUpperCase()}
                  ratio="vertical"
                  maxH="max-h-[32svh] md:max-h-[56svh]"
